KG42.register("clusters-ac24a241c86f8b5287db3e60",{"id":"12-p2p_microgrid_trading::v142-d-K005","paper":"12-p2p_microgrid_trading","label":"Eligibility of consumers and prosumers with flexible loads as non-cooperative players","record":{"cluster_id":"v142-d-K005","label":"Eligibility of consumers and prosumers with flexible loads as non-cooperative players","market_meaning":"Includes consumers and prosumers with flexible loads among the players in the single-period non-cooperative bidding model, retaining the assumption of competitive participation without obtaining additional benefits through cooperative aggregation.","mechanism_ids":["v141-a-M03"],"market_types":["LEM"],"process_stages":["participation"],"scope_disposition":"compatible","scope_explanation":"The two chains jointly correspond to the scope of players in the same game, with consumers and prosumers representing distinct participation roles. The two definitions of N refer to the same set of game players; the consumer binding in R016 is not misread as meaning that N contains only consumers, nor is this simulation assumption generalized to the general group participation in M01.","assembly_status":"partial","boundary_rationale":"The eligibility of the two types of entities and the assumption of independent decision-making jointly define the game players and have a distinct participation-rule meaning. Repeated definitions of the player set are retained only as associated representations; this cluster does not claim that strategy, payoff, or equilibrium solution rules have already been assembled.","chain_bindings":[{"chain_id":"v141-c-R016","ownership":"primary","role":"core","rationale":"Provides consumer eligibility, the competition assumption, and the existing parameter records for the player set."},{"chain_id":"v141-c-R017","ownership":"primary","role":"core","rationale":"Supplements prosumer eligibility and the scope of competitive participation in the same game."}],"connections":[{"connection_id":"v142-d-K005-L001","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R016","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R017","kind":"complementary_scope","from_refs":["v141-c-R016::phi::v141-c-R016-C001","v141-c-R016::phi::v141-c-R016-C002"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R017::phi::v141-c-R017-C001","v141-c-R017::phi::v141-c-R017-C002"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-ev-30","v141-b-g01-ev-36"],"rationale":"The source explicitly includes both consumers and prosumers with flexible loads, with both subject to the assumption of competition without aggregation; the two chains complete the scope of entities rather than forming two different games."},{"connection_id":"v142-d-K005-L002","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R016","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R017","kind":"alternative_representation","from_refs":["v141-c-R016::phi::v141-c-R016-C003"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R017::phi::v141-c-R017-C003"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-ev-36"],"rationale":"The two player-set definitions originate from the same game definition and are attached to different participation nodes; this association concerns only the set definition and does not treat the two participation chains as duplicates in their entirety."}],"object_mappings":[{"mapping_id":"v142-d-K005-O001","kind":"same_expression","member_refs":["v141-c-R016::phi::v141-c-R016-C003","v141-c-R017::phi::v141-c-R017-C003"],"canonical_ref":null,"display_policy":"linked_distinct","evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-ev-36"],"rationale":"The source defines the set of all players in the same game, and the mathematical content of the two expressions is identical. Their local node bindings, constraint types, and parameter references differ, so both are retained alongside one another without automatically adding parameter records to R017."}],"gaps":[{"gap_id":"v142-d-K005-G001","category":"ambiguous_mapping","description":"The quantified membership expression in R017-C002 does not appear verbatim in the cited original eligibility text, but the frozen formalization_origin is source; the existing record mixes source wording with formalized interpretation.","chain_ids":["v141-c-R017"],"object_refs":["v141-c-R017::phi::v141-c-R017-C002"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-ev-36","v141-b-g01-ev-37"],"proposal_ids":[],"required_work":"Have C review the formalization origin and citation basis of this expression; D retains the existing expression and marker without claiming that it has passed verification against formulas in the original text."},{"gap_id":"v142-d-K005-G002","category":"math_incomplete","description":"R016 registers n and N as parameters, whereas R017 uses these symbols without registering or referencing the corresponding objects. Associations between expressions across chains cannot replace closure of local quantity roles and references.","chain_ids":["v141-c-R016","v141-c-R017"],"object_refs":["v141-c-R016::theta::v141-c-R016-TH001","v141-c-R016::theta::v141-c-R016-TH002","v141-c-R016::phi::v141-c-R016-C003","v141-c-R017::phi::v141-c-R017-C002","v141-c-R017::phi::v141-c-R017-C003"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-ev-36"],"proposal_ids":[],"required_work":"Have the registration and referencing policies for the number of players, the player set, and indices clarified upstream; retain the frozen objects of both chains without copying or merging them into new parameter objects in D."},{"gap_id":"v142-d-K005-G003","category":"upstream_missing","description":"B contains material on strategies, payoffs, comfort, and equilibrium solution, but the current C catalog lacks the corresponding complete Rule-Chains, so bidding outcomes cannot be derived from player eligibility. The related resource and equilibrium proposals remain unapproved; this gap limits extension to a complete bidding mechanism.","chain_ids":["v141-c-R016","v141-c-R017"],"object_refs":["v141-c-R016::phi::v141-c-R016-C001","v141-c-R017::phi::v141-c-R017-C002"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-ev-32","v141-b-g01-ev-33","v141-b-g01-ev-35","v141-b-g02-E06","v141-b-g02-E07","v141-b-g02-E09","v141-b-g02-E11","v141-b-g02-E12","v141-b-g02-E13","v141-b-g02-E14","v141-b-g02-E15"],"proposal_ids":["v141-b-g01-prop-03","v141-b-g01-prop-04","v141-b-g02-P01"],"required_work":"Have the strategy, payoff, and equilibrium Rule-Chains for the same mechanism extracted upstream, verify formula conditions and quantity roles, and address pending proposals manually; D cannot directly add equations from B to scientific object arrays."},{"gap_id":"v142-d-K005-G004","category":"unverified_source","description":"The sources for eligibility, the competition assumption, and the player set all remain unverified; the semantic association between repeated expressions is only a candidate judgment in this round.","chain_ids":["v141-c-R016","v141-c-R017"],"object_refs":[],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-ev-30","v141-b-g01-ev-32","v141-b-g01-ev-33","v141-b-g01-ev-34","v141-b-g01-ev-35","v141-b-g01-ev-36","v141-b-g01-ev-37"],"proposal_ids":[],"required_work":"Manually check the complete player definition, the scope of role applicability, and formula sources, and examine the existing formalized content in C."}]},"rule_refs":["12-p2p_microgrid_trading::v141-c-R016","12-p2p_microgrid_trading::v141-c-R017"],"unresolved_rule_refs":[],"node_ids":["COMP-a774da994c2ca212"]});
